    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_hagane_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "F5E55EB69A7AFAB4",
      "text": "學校真是個好玩的地方～[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_hagane_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "F5E561B69A7AFFCD",
      "text": "波琵我還沒有\\n去學校上過學。[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_hagane_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "F5E560B69A7AFE1A",
      "text": "教室，還有老師，通通都是\\n第一次看到，我好興奮喔～！[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_hagane_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "F5E55BB69A7AF59B",
      "text": "有一天波琵我也能當學生\\n去學校上課嗎～……[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_hagane_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "AF6085727E6268D3",
      "text": "當然了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_hagane_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "AF6086727E626A86",
      "text": "我想會的……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_hagane_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "F5E55AB69A7AF3E8",
      "text": "……嗯！[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳說得對！[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 4,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
