      "hash64": "9DBC643197C9FA18",
      "text": "６歲",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_hagane_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "9DBC673197C9FF31",
      "text": "９歲",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_hagane_sp03_select_03",
      "hash64": "9DBC663197C9FD7E",
      "text": "１２歲",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_hagane_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "F72087BBC1885BB0",
      "text": "哼～！波琵我才不是\\n那麼小的小朋友呢！[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_hagane_sp03_02b",
      "hash64": "74A27609DAB405D6",
      "text": "哎呀呀～！好厲害呀！\\n第一次有人答對！[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_hagane_sp03_02c",
      "hash64": "74A27709DAB40789",
      "text": "哎呀呀～！波琵我\\n看起來那麼像個大姐姐呀～！？[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_hagane_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "F72088BBC1885D63",
      "text": "波琵我今年９歲，\\n以我的年紀，其實已經\\r\\n可以到學院上學了喔！[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_hagane_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "F7208DBBC18865E2",
      "text": "但是波琵我的寶可夢太強了，\\n會給大家添麻煩……\\r\\n所以我就主動放棄入學了。[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_hagane_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "F7208EBBC1886795",
      "text": "然後也慈姐姐她就來邀請\\n波琵我當四天王……[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0014"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "coach_paldea4kings_hagane_sp03_06",
      "hash64": "F7208BBBC188627C",
      "text": "但是看著藍～莓的大家，\\n波琵我發現了一件事情！[VAR 0x0114(0014)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
